    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "我们都很渴",
      "title_en": "We were all thirsty",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["前天", "，", "我", "和", "朋友", "们", "去", "打球", "。", "天气", "很", "热", "，", "我们", "都", "很", "渴", "。"],
        ["我们", "喝", "了", "很", "多", "水", "，", "还是", "很", "渴", "。", "一", "个", "朋友", "去", "商店", "买", "了", "很", "多", "水", "。"],
        ["我们", "一边", "喝", "，", "一边", "笑", "。", "最后", "，", "我们", "进", "了", "三", "个", "球", "！"],
        ["朋友", "说", "：", "“", "后天", "我们", "再", "来", "！", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "好", "！", "我", "会", "拿", "很", "多", "水", "来", "。", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "The day before yesterday I played football with my friends. It was hot, and we were all thirsty.",
        "We drank loads of water but were still thirsty. One friend went to the shop and bought lots more.",
        "We laughed as we drank. In the end we scored three goals!",
        "My friend said: “Let’s come again the day after tomorrow!” I said: “OK! I’ll bring lots of water.”"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["前天", "渴", "后天"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "前天", "english": "the day before yesterday" },
        { "word": "渴", "english": "thirsty" },
        { "word": "后天", "english": "the day after tomorrow" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "archive fashion",
      "title_zh": "电影里的衣服",
      "title_en": "The clothes in the film",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["星期天", "，", "我", "和", "女朋友", "去", "电影院", "看", "电影", "。"],
        ["电影", "里", "的", "男人", "穿", "着", "很", "好看", "的", "老", "衣服", "。"],
        ["女朋友", "说", "：", "“", "那", "个", "衣服", "跟", "你", "的", "一样", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "笑", "了", "：", "“", "对", "，", "我", "也", "有", "！", "是", "我", "去年", "在", "网上", "买", "的", "。", "”"],
        ["看", "了", "电影", "，", "我们", "去", "吃", "晚饭", "。", "我们", "说", "了", "很", "多", "衣服", "的", "事", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "On Sunday my girlfriend and I went to the cinema to see a film.",
        "The man in the film was wearing really nice vintage clothes.",
        "My girlfriend said: “That’s just like yours!”",
        "I laughed: “Yes, I’ve got one too! I bought it online last year.”",
        "After the film we went for dinner. We talked about clothes a lot."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["电影院"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "电影院", "english": "cinema" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "missions": [
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-m1",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "At the cinema",
      "role": "工作人员",
      "goal": "Ask a member of staff where the toilet is, when the film starts and where to buy water.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "洗手间", "english": "toilet" },
        { "word": "电影院", "english": "cinema" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "欢迎来电影院！有什么事？",
          "partner_en": "Welcome to the cinema! Can I help?",
          "prompt_en": "Ask where the toilet is.",
          "answers_zh": ["请问，洗手间在哪儿？", "洗手间在哪里？"],
          "answers_en": ["Excuse me, where's the toilet?", "Where's the toilet?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "在楼上，左边。",
          "partner_en": "Upstairs, on the left.",
          "prompt_en": "Ask what time the film starts.",
          "answers_zh": ["电影几点开始？", "几点开始？"],
          "answers_en": ["What time does the film start?", "When does it start?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "七点半，还有十分钟。",
          "partner_en": "Half past seven — ten minutes from now.",
          "prompt_en": "Say thanks, and ask where to buy water.",
          "answers_zh": ["谢谢。在哪儿买水？", "谢谢。这里能买水吗？"],
          "answers_en": ["Thanks. Where can I buy water?", "Thanks. Can I buy water here?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "在那边。",
          "partner_en": "Over there.",
          "prompt_en": "Say thank you.",
          "answers_zh": ["好的，谢谢！", "谢谢你！"],
          "answers_en": ["OK, thanks!", "Thank you!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "不客气，看得开心！",
      "closing_en": "You're welcome — enjoy the film!"
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-08-m2",
      "level": 1,
      "title": "Asking for a day off",
      "role": "老师",
      "goal": "Phone your teacher to ask for tomorrow off to see a doctor, and find out what the class will cover.",
      "new_words": [
        { "word": "请假", "english": "to ask for time off" },
        { "word": "看病", "english": "to see a doctor" },
        { "word": "下课", "english": "after class; class finishes" }
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "partner_zh": "喂，你好。",
          "partner_en": "Hello?",
          "prompt_en": "Say hello, and that you'd like to take tomorrow off.",
          "answers_zh": ["老师好，我明天想请假。", "老师，我明天要请假。"],
          "answers_en": ["Hello, I'd like to take tomorrow off.", "I need to take tomorrow off."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "怎么了？",
          "partner_en": "What's wrong?",
          "prompt_en": "Say you have to see a doctor.",
          "answers_zh": ["我要去看病。", "我生病了，要去医院。"],
          "answers_en": ["I need to see a doctor.", "I'm ill and need to go to hospital."]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "好的，你好好休息。",
          "partner_en": "OK, get some good rest.",
          "prompt_en": "Ask what the class will do tomorrow.",
          "answers_zh": ["明天学什么？", "明天的课学什么？"],
          "answers_en": ["What are we doing tomorrow?", "What's tomorrow's lesson on?"]
        },
        {
          "partner_zh": "学第五课。下课以后我给你发信息。",
          "partner_en": "Lesson five. I'll message you after class.",
          "prompt_en": "Say thank you.",
          "answers_zh": ["谢谢老师！", "好的，谢谢！"],
          "answers_en": ["Thank you!", "OK, thanks!"]
        }
      ],
      "closing_zh": "不客气，早点好起来！",
      "closing_en": "You're welcome — get well soon!"
    }
  ]
